{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670919675982858522","title":"增程能量管理开发工程师-汽车","description":"1. 负责增程控制系统技术方案，技术规范及技术路线的调研及编制；负责增程系统的功能设计，系统实现和性能开发工作；\n2. 负责高压能量管理控制策略设计与算法开发和测试标定工作；\n3. 负责增程系统能量管理功能调试，支持能耗和排放相关策略的调试；\n4. 负责编写和维护增程系统能量管理系统开发和技术文档；\n5.负责解决功能软件开发和功能测试过程中的问题；","requirement":"1. 本科/硕士，车辆工程、控制科学与工程、机械电子、动力工程等相关专业；\n2. 熟悉控制基础原理，了解电机，电池等零部件技术和系统，VCU控制系统与相关系统的交互关系（物理接口、信号接口、车辆动力学关系）；\n3. 熟练使用MATLAB/Simulink进行控制算法开发与仿真；\n4. 良好的逻辑思维和问题分析能力，具备团队协作精神；\n5. 如有赛车/方程式车队或相关竞赛经历更佳；","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786025248604,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7615833493755676955","name":"整车与系统工程类","en_name":"Vehicle and Systems Engineering","i18n_name":"整车与系统工程类"},"job_id":"7670919675982694682","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_na